### Mermaid role legend (product + agent chat)

When drawing Focus architecture diagrams in **CLI/PR HUD** or **in Cursor chat**, use the same roles:

| Role | Meaning | Mermaid class |
|---|---|---|
| **seed** | Changed file(s) | `classDef seed` (blue) |
| **danger** | Danger Zone | `classDef danger` (amber) |
| **downstream** | Blast-radius dependent | `classDef downstream` (gray) |

Colors are presentation only — never invent nodes/edges. Prefer `classDef` + `class` over per-node `style`. Pair with a short text legend.

